   {
    "id": 58390,
    "name": "Detail Tweaker LoRA (细节调整LoRA)",
    "description": "<p>HF: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/OedoSoldier/detail-tweaker-lora\">https://huggingface.co/OedoSoldier/detail-tweaker-lora</a></p><p>This is a LoRA for enhancing/diminishing detail while keeping the overall style/character; it works well with all kinds of base models (incl anime &amp; realistic models)/style LoRA/character LoRA, etc.</p><p>Apply your own weight; this LoRA can be utilized for any weight up/down to 2/-2!</p><p><strong>Note: use a negative weight to reduce details!</strong></p>",
